      "created_at": "2020-10-16T04:12:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh my gosh, there’s so much to love here! Tachyon’s was already a fave, for sure, but Absolute Zero’s theme felt like&nbsp;him on a really deep level (and obviously the jazzy feel made a lot of sense). I really liked Captain Cosmic’s theme, too, and then Fanatic’s was just...whoa.</p>\n<p>I love these themes so so much!</p>\n<p>edit: and you’re so right about Omni-X, what a great piece!</p>",
